Package: registry-rust
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6, adduser, ca-certificates, systemd | systemd-sysv
Description: OCI Distribution Registry (Rust)
 A lightweight OCI/Docker registry implementation in Rust.
 .
 It supports basic push/pull workflows and is suitable for local or
 on-prem deployments.
 .
 The same `registry-rust` binary also includes maintenance subcommands
 such as `ref-index` and `blob-gc`.
